  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Statement of need, C-001-C01, 570_E_201-P4, 570_E_120-P1, 570_E_220-P4, 570_E_200-P1 & 570_E_100-P1  Received: 05/11/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The Cafe & Activity Hub shall be used as for Class A3 (Restaurants and cafes), Class D1 (Non-residential institutions and Class D2 (Assembly and leisure) and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification).",
    "Condition : 5 - The use of the caf? and education space hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority. The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the caf? and education space is first used.",
    "Condition : 6 - The cumulative noise from any fixed external plant associated with the scheme shall not exceed levels more than 5 dB below background (LA90) levels at free field locations representing facades of nearby existing and proposed dwellings.  Noise levels must be assessed by measurement or calculation based on the guidance presented within BS4142: 2014+A1:2019 or subsequent versions of this guidance.",
    "Condition : 7 - The materials to be used in the construction of all external surfaces hereby permitted must be those approved under application 00133/H/S17(7) with any variation to be submitted and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 8 - Prior to occupation, the Cafe & Activity Hub space shall have been completed in accordance with the details approved under planning decision reference 00133/H/S17(22)."
  ],
